<div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2>Why SIPROTEC 7SJ85?</h2><p>The SIPROTEC 7SJ85 is an overcurrent protection device designed for feeders, lines and capacitor banks. Its modular structure and powerful DIGSI 5 engineering tool offer flexible, future-oriented solutions for protection, control and automation. Conformal coating of the electronic boards ensures the highest availability and safety, even under extreme environmental conditions. With its modular structure, flexibility and the powerful DIGSI 5 engineering tool, the SIPROTEC 7SJ85 device offers future-oriented solutions for protection, control, automation, monitoring and PQ basic.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div id='477HowxG15o7JuQa6sfaFc' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_2' data-ste-section-id='477HowxG15o7JuQa6sfaFc'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-477HowxG15o7JuQa6sfaFc" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="477HowxG15o7JuQa6sfaFc" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-477HowxG15o7JuQa6sfaFc"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div class="group-focus"><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><strong class="text-kicker">FEATURED CAPABILITIES</strong><h2><span>Features &amp; functions</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Highest availability" id="G_Highest%20availability-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Highest%20availability-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Highest%20availability-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"><pic